---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Cookie Policy" 
  description="Information about cookies used on ZenZone."
>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none mx-auto bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 my-8">
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: July 24, 2026</p>

    <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
    <p>A cookie is a file downloaded to your device when accessing certain websites. Cookies allow a website to store and retrieve information about browsing habits to recognize returning visitors.</p>

    <h2>Types of cookies used</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Technical Cookies:</strong> Necessary for smooth navigation and core website functions.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics & Google Signals Cookies:</strong> Measure traffic and page usage (via Google Analytics 4 with Google Signals and Consent Mode v2) to obtain aggregated demographic insights when explicit consent is provided.</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate Cookies:</strong> Used by Amazon EU to attribute qualifying purchases originated from outbound affiliate product links within 24 hours.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Managing Cookies</h2>
    <p>You can allow, block, or delete cookies through your web browser settings:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google Chrome:</strong> Settings &gt; Privacy and security &gt; Cookies.</li>
      <li><strong>Mozilla Firefox:</strong> Settings &gt; Privacy &amp; Security.</li>
      <li><strong>Safari:</strong> Preferences &gt; Privacy.</li>
      <li><strong>Microsoft Edge:</strong> Settings &gt; Privacy, search, and services.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Consent</h2>
    <p>By continuing to navigate our website, you consent to the use of cookies under the terms outlined in this policy.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
